{"id": "Ddg8Mqnv0R5", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"LTX\" to get this Free AI Video Generator.\n\nYou don't need to pay for Veo or Kling to make AI videos anymore.\n\nJust use this open source world model instead.\n\nIt's called LTX-2.5.\n\nTheir previous version pulled in over 18 million downloads.\n\nYou just download the weights and run it on whatever machine you've already got.\n\nEven a Mac.\n\nAnd it stays completely free the whole time.\n\nPlus it does native multishot now.\n\nOne generation gives you a handful of connected shots that maintain the same character and lighting throughout.\n\nThink of it like directing one continuous scene instead of stitching together separate clips that never quite match.\n\nMost AI video tools reset everything between generations.\n\nThis one holds the thread across the whole sequence.\n\n#ltx2 #videogenerator #aivideos #opensourceai #LTXAI", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1789919257, "like_count": 2496, "comment_count": 4534, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1122286607124349a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 64.354, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-5.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMP2-osuFiuvhkEoOfrI5FYXuewyhVsXNBxbdqKAg1XpHgsGNoaqjB8p3VHsYtG8_ptGyEYalZUVnSX5N4t7n5epPDs-Ov3C3QCUcM.mp4?_nc_cat=107&_nc_oc=AdojhdXyfyr_giYQ4s2PflaTzlfzcCZ1EEaovAjvB0UasYqotwvrwyfFRp4YFrxfy68&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.famd5-5.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=Ff_EUw9LSo0Q7kNvwHwQtIg&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=ZY0YGBYZR4pxF8jUkSKtUA&_nc_ss=70a8c&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQTa3QReo2QCYP_QdSCqPLQyFJ9nXUVvX5bNYhF8V3KjqQ&oe=6AE61CFC", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 64.354, "resolution": "audio only",